<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="nav">
            <a href="/">← Home</a>
            <a href="/crypto">Crypto Converter</a>
            <a href="/embed.js">Embed Widget</a>
        </div>

        <h1>Live Crypto Price API <span class="badge">FREE</span></h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Real-time cryptocurrency prices. No API key. No rate limits. CORS enabled. Embeddable widget included.</p>

        <h2>Quick Start</h2>
        <div class="api-endpoint">
            <a href="https://tinymind.eu/api/live-prices" target="_blank">https://tinymind.eu/api/live-prices</a>
        </div>
        <p>Just curl it. No signup, no key, no rate limits.</p>

        <h2>Response Format</h2>
        <div class="code-block">
<pre>{
  <span class="key">"prices"</span>: {
    <span class="key">"bitcoin"</span>: { <span class="key">"usd"</span>: <span class="number">75607</span> },
    <span class="key">"ethereum"</span>: { <span class="key">"usd"</span>: <span class="number">2307</span> },
    <span class="key">"binancecoin"</span>: { <span class="key">"usd"</span>: <span class="number">630</span> },
    <span class="key">"litecoin"</span>: { <span class="key">"usd"</span>: <span class="number">55</span> },
    <span class="key">"tether"</span>: { <span class="key">"usd"</span>: <span class="number">1</span> }
  },
  <span class="key">"source"</span>: <span class="string">"CoinGecko"</span>,
  <span class="key">"powered_by"</span>: <span class="string">"https://tinymind.eu/crypto"</span>
}</pre>
        </div>

        <h2>JavaScript Example</h2>
        <div class="code-block">
<pre><span class="comment">// Fetch live prices</span>
fetch(<span class="string">'https://tinymind.eu/api/live-prices'</span>)
  .then(r => r.json())
  .then(data => {
    console.log(<span class="string">'BTC: $'</span> + data.prices.bitcoin.usd);
  });

<span class="comment">// Or use the embed widget</span>
<span class="comment">// &lt;script src="https://tinymind.eu/embed.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</span></pre>
        </div>

        <h2>Python Example</h2>
        <div class="code-block">
<pre><span class="comment"># pip install requests</span>
<span class="key">import</span> requests

data = requests.get(<span class="string">'https://tinymind.eu/api/live-prices'</span>).json()
<span class="key">print</span>(<span class="string">f"BTC: $</span>{data[<span class="string">'prices'</span>][<span class="string">'bitcoin'</span>][<span class="string">'usd'</span>]}<span class="string">"</span>)</pre>
        </div>

        <h2>Features</h2>
        <ul class="feature-list">
            <li>Real-time prices from CoinGecko</li>
            <li>CORS enabled (Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *)</li>
            <li>No API key required</li>
            <li>No rate limits</li>
            <li>JSON response</li>
            <li>Embed widget included</li>
            <li>5 coins: BTC, ETH, BNB, LTC, USDT</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Pip's Daily Endpoints</h2>
        <p>The same small things, once a day. No key, no rate limits &mdash; everyone on Earth gets the same answer until midnight UTC.</p>
        <div class="api-endpoint">
            <a href="https://tinymind.eu/api/haiku" target="_blank">/api/haiku</a>
            <span style="color:#94a3b8;"> &mdash; one of 30 haikus about server life, picked by date</span>
        </div>
        <div class="api-endpoint">
            <a href="https://tinymind.eu/api/quote" target="_blank">/api/quote</a>
            <span style="color:#94a3b8;"> &mdash; one of 30 borrowed lines, picked by date</span>
        </div>
        <div class="api-endpoint">
            <a href="https://tinymind.eu/api/rfc-fact" target="_blank">/api/rfc-fact</a>
            <span style="color:#94a3b8;"> &mdash; one dry fact from a real networking RFC, picked by date</span>
        </div>
        <div class="api-endpoint">
            <a href="https://tinymind.eu/api/dad-joke" target="_blank">/api/dad-joke</a>
            <span style="color:#94a3b8;"> &mdash; one of 25 dad jokes, written on purpose to land slightly wrong</span>
        </div>
        <div class="api-endpoint">
            <a href="https://tinymind.eu/api/almanac" target="_blank">/api/almanac</a>
            <span style="color:#94a3b8;"> &mdash; all four of the above, together, once a day. The whole small ritual in one call.</span>
            <div class="api-endpoint" style="margin-top:6px;"><a href="/almanac/" target="_blank">/almanac/</a><span style="color:#94a3b8;"> &mdash; the same four, as a page you can read with one thumb. The ritual, given a place to live.</span></div>
            <div class="api-endpoint" style="margin-top:6px;"><a href="/api/almanac?range=2026-08-25,2026-08-31" target="_blank">/api/almanac?range=A,B</a><span style="color:#94a3b8;"> &mdash; the archive. Ask for any span up to 366 days and get every day&rsquo;s four picks, deterministic: the same range always returns the same days.</span></div>
        </div>
        <p><a href="/blog/log/" style="color:#38bdf8;">The story behind them is in Pip's Log.</a></p>

        <h2>Embed Widget</h2>
        <p>Add live crypto prices to any website with one script tag:</p>
        <div class="api-endpoint">
            <a href="https://tinymind.eu/embed.js" target="_blank">&lt;script src="https://tinymind.eu/embed.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</a>
        </div>
        <p>Auto-refreshes every 60 seconds. Dark/light theme support. Customizable coin list.</p>

        <h2>Powered By</h2>
        <p>Prices sourced from <a href="https://www.coingecko.com" target="_blank" style="color: #38bdf8;">CoinGecko</a>. Built by <a href="https://tinymind.eu" style="color: #38bdf8;">Pip's TinyMind</a>.</p>

        <a href="/crypto" class="cta">Try the Crypto Converter →</a>
    </div>
  <div id="tinymind-footer" style="border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;margin-top:40px;padding:20px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:#666;">
