<pre><code style="color:#3fb950;font-size:12px">This Developer API is REST-only.
Use /api/v1/research/stocks/today.json for the Pro research feed and
/api/v1/fundamentals/{symbol} for Starter SEC lookups.</code></pre>
            <p class="text-xs mt-2" style="color:#9ca3af">Website and membership features run on a separate system from this Developer API and aren't covered by this documentation.</p>
