<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en" class="geistsans_d5a4f12f-module__Ur3q_a__variable geistmono_157ca88a-module__iaM1Ya__variable"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/GeistMono_Variable.p.1216mhqx6y_is.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/Geist_Variable-s.p.06.f0v_2js29o.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/chunks/0qufb15biyr2k.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/0tyn_~2g0ue_3.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0mu1qslb0zv9i.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0du0~yhcl1wqo.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0l4caf27dl1-p.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-0ejdfncxl9d~r.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0aafum-uxy~fp.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/01xlw8hd842-c.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/01tlc1x287zz5.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/04dgzpzr9u93n.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0h_k22_rbg_v3.js" async=""></script><meta name="next-size-adjust" content=""/><meta name="theme-color" content="#102233"/><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"/><title>Public API — error codes and search | ModelPartFinder</title><meta name="description" content="Free, no-auth JSON endpoints for lightweight error-code lookup and catalog search. Endpoints are rate limited and best-effort."/><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"/><meta name="keywords" content="replacement parts,part number lookup,appliance parts,model number parts,find the right part,where to buy parts,HVAC parts,OEM replacement parts"/><meta name="category" content="technology"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://modelpartfinder.com/docs/api"/><meta name="msvalidate.01" content="73A50E0DFFF31C401CED3D9C84769C53"/><meta name="fo-verify" content="9f2b0eb9-ed63-49fd-9ad3-8224ff4e320f"/><meta property="og:title" content="ModelPartFinder"/><meta property="og:description" content="Search part numbers, models, manufacturers, categories, and documents."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://modelpartfinder.com"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="ModelPartFinder"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://modelpartfinder.com/opengraph-image?d566d0c597badd57"/><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="modelpartfinder.com — multi-store parts comparison directory"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="ModelPartFinder"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Search part numbers, models, manufacturers, categories, and documents."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://modelpartfinder.com/opengraph-image?d566d0c597badd57"/><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="modelpartfinder.com — multi-store parts comparison directory"/><meta name="twitter:image:type" content="image/png"/><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="1200"/><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="630"/><link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico?v=20260409b"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico?v=20260409b" sizes="any"/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg?v=20260409b" type="image/svg+xml"/><link rel="icon" href="/icon-192.png?v=20260409b" type="image/png" sizes="192x192"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png?v=20260409b" sizes="180x180" type="image/png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/03~yq9q893hmn.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://modelpartfinder.com/#org","name":"ModelPartFinder","url":"https://modelpartfinder.com","logo":"https://modelpartfinder.com/icon-192.png","contactPoint":{"@type":"ContactPoint","contactType":"customer support","email":"hello@modelpartfinder.com","url":"https://modelpartfinder.com/contact"}},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://modelpartfinder.com/#website","name":"ModelPartFinder","url":"https://modelpartfinder.com","publisher":{"@id":"https://modelpartfinder.com/#org"},"potentialAction":{"@type":"SearchAction","target":{"@type":"EntryPoint","urlTemplate":"https://modelpartfinder.com/part-numbers?q={search_term_string}"},"query-input":"required name=search_term_string"}}]}</script><a class="skip-to-main" href="#main">Skip to content</a><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--><div class="page-chrome"><header class="topbar"><div class="topbar-shell"><a class="brand-mark" href="/"><span class="brand-icon">MP</span><strong class="brand-text">ModelPartFinder</strong></a><form class="top-search" role="search" action="/part-numbers" method="get"><label class="top-search-field"><span class="sr-only">Search part numbers, models, or brands</span><input class="top-search-input" type="search" placeholder="Part, model, brand, category" name="q" value=""/></label><button class="top-search-button" type="submit">Go</button></form><nav class="topnav" aria-label="Primary"><a href="/part-numbers">Part Numbers</a><a href="/models">Models</a><a href="/brands">Brands</a><a href="/categories">Categories</a></nav></div></header><main class="main-shell" id="main" tabindex="-1"><section class="section-shell page-shell"><nav class="breadcrumb-trail" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/docs">Docs</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>API</span></nav><div class="section-heading section-heading-flat"><div><p class="section-kicker">API</p><h1>Public API</h1></div></div><p style="max-width:65ch;margin:0.5rem 0 1.2rem;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.55">No auth or signup for lightweight use. The exposed endpoints are rate limited, best-effort, and built for lookup widgets, diagnostics, and internal tools that can tolerate catalog changes.</p><article class="glass-card detail-panel detail-panel-compact record-table-shell"><div class="record-section-heading"><h2>Endpoint: GET /api/v1/error-code/{brand}/{code}</h2></div><p style="padding:0.4rem 0;opacity:0.85">Look up a single error code by brand and code identifier. Returns the description, the appliance type, recommended replacement SKUs (with our /parts/&lt;sku&gt; URL), and the canonical /error-codes/ landing page.</p><pre style="background:rgba(0,0,0,0.4);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:0.4rem;padding:1rem;overflow:auto;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.5">curl -s https://modelpartfinder.com/api/v1/error-code/Whirlpool/F01

{
  &quot;ok&quot;: true,
  &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Whirlpool&quot;,
  &quot;code&quot;: &quot;F01&quot;,
  &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Main control board failure&quot;,
  &quot;appliance&quot;: &quot;Washer&quot;,
  &quot;recommended_skus&quot;: [
    {
      &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;WPW10189966&quot;,
      &quot;mpn&quot;: &quot;WPW10189966&quot;,
      &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Whirlpool washer main control board&quot;,
      &quot;manufacturer&quot;: &quot;Whirlpool&quot;,
      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://modelpartfinder.com/parts/wpw10189966-whirlpool-washer-main-control-board&quot;,
      &quot;price_cents&quot;: 24999
    }
  ],
  &quot;source_url&quot;: &quot;https://modelpartfinder.com/error-codes/whirlpool-f01&quot;
}</pre><p style="padding:0.4rem 0;opacity:0.85">Brand is matched case-insensitively; code is normalized to upper-case. Returns 404 with<!-- --> <code>{&quot;detail&quot;:&quot;Unknown brand/code combination&quot;}</code> if the combination isn&#x27;t in our index.</p></article><article class="glass-card detail-panel detail-panel-compact record-table-shell"><div class="record-section-heading"><h2>Recall feed pilot</h2><p class="record-subline" style="margin:0.25rem 0 0;opacity:0.75;font-size:0.85rem">For property-management software, home-warranty, insurance MGAs, and REI portfolio managers.</p></div><p style="padding:0.4rem;line-height:1.55">Recall data is available in the private backend and public recall pages. A commercial feed should stay private-pilot only until keys, metering, delta generation, and uptime reporting are built:</p><ul style="padding-left:1.2rem;line-height:1.6"><li><strong>Pilot scope:</strong> daily export or manual portfolio check for a named customer.</li><li><strong>Not public yet:</strong> automated keys, real-time webhooks, customer-specific filters, and a contractual uptime SLA.</li></ul><p style="padding:0.4rem;line-height:1.55">Email<!-- --> <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#167e737a7a79567b7972737a66776462707f787273643875797b296563747c7375622b447375777a7a33242670737372332426667f7a7962"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="167e737a7a79567b7972737a66776462707f787273643875797b">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> <!-- -->with portfolio profile and we will quote only what can be fulfilled from the current dataset.</p></article><article class="glass-card detail-panel detail-panel-compact record-table-shell"><div class="record-section-heading"><h2>Other free integrations</h2></div><ul style="padding-left:1.2rem;line-height:1.7"><li><a href="/embed">Embeddable parts-lookup widget</a> — drop an iframe into any blog, forum, or knowledge-base.</li><li><a href="/feed.xml">Atom feed</a> — subscribe to new parts indexed in the catalog.</li><li><a href="/sitemap-index.xml">Split sitemap index</a> — 8 sub-sitemaps covering long-tail URLs across parts, models, brands, symptoms, error-codes, and comparisons.</li></ul></article><article class="glass-card detail-panel detail-panel-compact record-table-shell"><div class="record-section-heading"><h2>Terms of use</h2></div><ul style="padding-left:1.2rem;line-height:1.6"><li>Free for lightweight use. Contact us before bulk or commercial redistribution.</li><li>Data is best-effort accurate but not warranted — verify before acting on it.</li><li>Excessive crawling will be rate-limited at the edge. If you need bulk access, reach out before scraping at scale.</li></ul></article></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="footer-shell"><div class="footer-bar"><div class="footer-links footer-links-inline"><a href="/cross-reference">Cross-Reference</a><a href="/data">Open data</a><a href="/glossary">Glossary</a><a href="/how-to-use">How to use</a><a href="/sitemap">Sitemap</a><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a></div><p class="footer-copy">As an Amazon Associate, ModelPartFinder earns from qualifying purchases. Always check the part number and price on the store’s page before you order.</p></div></footer></div><script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js"></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0tyn_~2g0ue_3.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n3:I[23685,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0aafum-uxy~fp.js\"],\"FirstPartyAnalytics\"]\n4:I[48303,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0aafum-uxy~fp.js\"],\"SiteHeader\"]\n5:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/01xlw8hd842-c.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01tlc1x287zz5.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[8821,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0aafum-uxy~fp.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/04dgzpzr9u93n.js\"],\"default\"]