 combination\\\"}\"}],\" if the combination isn't in our index.\"]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"d:[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"glass-card detail-panel detail-panel-compact record-table-shell\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"record-section-heading\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"Recall feed pilot\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"record-subline\",\"style\":{\"margin\":\"0.25rem 0 0\",\"opacity\":0.75,\"fontSize\":\"0.85rem\"},\"children\":\"For property-management software, home-warranty, insurance MGAs, and REI portfolio managers.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"0.4rem\",\"lineHeight\":1.55},\"children\":\"Recall data is available in the private backend and public recall pages. A commercial feed should stay private-pilot only until keys, metering, delta generation, and uptime reporting are built:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"style\":{\"paddingLeft\":\"1.2rem\",\"lineHeight\":1.6},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Pilot scope:\"}],\" daily export or manual portfolio check for a named customer.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Not public yet:\"}],\" automated keys, real-time webhooks, customer-specific filters, and a contractual uptime SLA.\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"padding\":\"0.4rem\",\"lineHeight\":1.55},\"children\":[\"Email\",\" \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"mailto:hello@modelpartfinder.com?subject=Recall%20feed%20pilot\",\"children\":\"hello@modelpartfinder.com\"}],\" \",\"with portfolio profile and we will quote only what can be fulfilled from the current dataset.\"]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"e:[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"glass-card detail-panel detail-panel-compact record-table-shell\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"record-section-heading\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"Other free int